 "description": "DSMZ culture medium 1881 (complex). Contains undefined components (2,4-Dichlorophenoxyacetic Acid, Ethanol absolute, Gamborg B5 Medium incl. Vitamins, Sucrose) rendered as a labeled in-silico hydrolysate approximation. Defined compounds mapped to BiGG (g/L->mM via molar mass); salts dissociated to ion exchanges.",
